      "summary": "build_01: Added the isolated root CMake configuration for the Spacing operator, targeting Ascend910B3 (ascend910b) and wiring host, kernel, and optional graph subdirectories into the CANN op package.; build_02: Add isolated build.sh for the Ascend910B3 spacing operator with SoC validation, CMake build, and artifact checks.; build_03: Added the host-side CMake configuration for the Spacing operator, wiring OpDef, InferShape, arch22 tiling, ACLNN L0/L2 API sources, and graph proto packaging for the Ascend910B3 target.; build_04: Add the Ascend C kernel build registration for the Spacing operator, targeting Ascend910B3/arch22 and wiring the kernel library into the package.; host_01: Added the Ascend C host operator definition for Spacing with one float32 input and float32 output, registered for Ascend910B.; host_02: Add host shape inference for Spacing, preserving the single input tensor shape as the output tensor shape.; host_03: Added Spacing arch22 host tiling with float32 validation, shape consistency checks, workspace declaration, multi-core/UB tiling parameters, and tiling registration.; kernel_01: Emit the arch22 kernel entry for Spacing: single-input/single-output float32 wiring (x, y, workspace, tiling) delegating Init/CopyIn/Compute/CopyOut to NsSpacing::Spacing, with defaulted tiling-key template parameters so the entry stays consistent with the single-dtype (float32) tiling-key declaration produced by the sibling stages.; kernel_02: Added arch22 Spacing kernel class with Init/CopyIn/Compute/CopyOut and float32 NumPy spacing bit-level semantics.; kernel_03: Added SpacingTilingData definition for arch22 kernel tiling.; kernel_04: Added arch22 Spacing tiling-key template declarations for float32-only input with selectable single/double buffering.; api_01: Added complete ACLNN L2 header for Spacing with two-stage unary tensor API.; api_02: Implemented the ACLNN L2 two-stage API for Spacing with float32 validation, shape checks, contiguous/view-copy handling, empty-tensor fast path, and workspace/executor lifecycle.; api_03: Added the L0 ACLNN header for the unary Spacing operator with the single-input signature used by the host and kernel stages.; api_04: Added L0 ACLNN implementation for Spacing targeting float32 Ascend910B3 only.; test_adapter_01: Added spacing contract tests with pure NumPy oracle coverage and guarded public asnumpy adapter tests.; test_adapter_02: Generated the unverified AsNumpy adapter manifest for Spacing, including explicit API/pybind/native/ACLNN mapping, bounded float32 profile support, rejection policy, special-value semantics, and exact numerical test contract.",
